1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,522
Siz tanladingiz!

2
00:00:01,542 --> 00:00:04,367
Zamin FKning yangi menejeri aniqlandi!

3
00:00:04,387 --> 00:00:05,475
Tabriklaymiz!

4
00:00:05,495 --> 00:00:07,991
Endi klubimizda yangi menejer bor!

5
00:00:08,011 --> 00:00:12,213
Lekin endi faqat menejer emas, siz ham qaror qabul qilasiz!

6
00:00:12,233 --> 00:00:15,644
Chunki bizda futbol klubi ham bor, o‘z shahrimiz ham!

7
00:00:15,664 --> 00:00:17,112
Klubga nima qo‘shamiz?

8
00:00:17,132 --> 00:00:18,552
Shaharda nima quramiz?

9
00:00:18,572 --> 00:00:22,472
Nimani o‘zgartiramiz yoki qanday yangi imkoniyat yaratamiz?

10
00:00:22,492 --> 00:00:24,366
Bu safar g‘oya sizdan!

11
00:00:24,386 --> 00:00:26,243
Izohga o‘z g‘oyangizni yozing!

12
00:00:26,363 --> 00:00:29,503
Klub uchunmi yoki shahar uchunmi farqi yo‘q!

13
00:00:29,523 --> 00:00:32,783
Eng ko‘p layk olgan izohdagi g‘oyani amalga oshiramiz!

14
00:00:32,803 --> 00:00:34,263
Yigirma to‘rt soat!

15
00:00:34,283 --> 00:00:36,614
Keyingi o‘zgarish sizning qo‘lingizda!

16
00:00:36,634 --> 00:00:39,194
Zamin FKni birgalikda quramiz!

